      "writtenOn": "2022-04-12T09:07:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "FWIW it seems like it might be better if this was in startMonitoring. Rationale:\n- The original S code did not rescan the system permissions when a user was added or removed, so OEMs probably aren\u0027t dependent on this.\n- It seems fairly arbitrary/unjustified to rescan the system permissions when a user is added or removed, but not when a package is installed or uninstalled.\n\nI don\u0027t feel very strongly about this though.",
      "range": {
